# Testing

- Unit tests for dag_loader, policy_gate, scoring, event schema.
- Integration: Temporal WorkflowEnvironment with mocked activities.
- Rego policies must have `*_test.rego` siblings.
- E2E smoke uses replay mode so CI does not require live LLM keys.
- Never assert on free-text LLM prose; assert on structured fields.
